1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:03,005
Lily and her brother Charlie enjoy having picnics in the countryside
莉莉和她的哥哥查理喜欢在乡下野餐

2
00:00:03,007 --> 00:00:06,605
Today they're having a picnic in the forest with their grandmother
今天他们要和祖母去森林野餐

3
00:00:06,607 --> 00:00:08,766
Lily and her grandmother are sitting on the blanket
莉莉和她奶奶坐在毯子上

4
00:00:08,766 --> 00:00:10,291
They're putting the picnic on it
他们要把野餐放在上面

5
00:00:10,326 --> 00:00:12,772
After lunch Lily wants to do herhomework
午饭后莉莉想做作业

6
00:00:12,807 --> 00:00:15,125
She must look at the plants and draw their leaves
她必须看着这些植物并画出它们的叶子

7
00:00:15,127 --> 00:00:18,806
Lily's looking at the bread because it's very old and they can't eat it for lunch
莉莉看着面包因为它太旧了他们不能把它当午饭吃

8
00:00:18,806 --> 00:00:20,492
Charlie's standing next to the lake
Charlie站在湖边

9
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:22,292
He's throwing bread to the ducks
他把面包扔给鸭子

10
00:00:22,446 --> 00:00:25,411
It isn't the bread for theducks it's the new bread for their picnic
这不是给鸭子的面包这是野餐用的新面包

11
00:00:25,446 --> 00:00:27,282
The ducks are eating his family's lunch!
鸭子们正在吃他家的午餐！

